      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SVENN (3) finished fourth last start, beaten 17 metres at Pinjarra over 1684m after getting badly checked in the running. Will enjoy a soft trip in the running from this favourable starting position. Good enough to take out a race like this. FILLMYPOCKET (6) has been most impressive of late and he made it two straight wins when scoring by a neck as the $2.70 favourite over 1730m at this track last start. Won't find this any harder and he can take care of this line-up. ULTIMATE EVENT (4) must be considered after she finished runner-up when resuming over 2130m at this track two weeks ago when trying to lead all of the way. Racing fitter could prove hard to catch. CRUNCHEE (5) must be respected after scoring an all of the way win first-up last start by 13 metres at Pinjarra over 1684m when she was well fancied. Races well at this track and is an each-way prospect.",
